{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":7,"ref":"song-of-songs 1:7","book":"song-of-songs","lang":"pcm","chapter":1,"translation":"Tell me, you wey my life dey love, how you dey feed, how you dey make ⟨them⟩ lie down for afternoon — why I go be like woman wey veil herself beside di flocks of your companions?","tokens":[{"surface":"הגידה","gloss":"tell"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"me"},{"surface":"שאהבה","gloss":"you wey"},{"surface":"נפשי","gloss":"my life dey love"},{"surface":"איכה","gloss":"how"},{"surface":"תרעה","gloss":"you dey feed"},{"surface":"איכה","gloss":"how"},{"surface":"תרביץ","gloss":"you dey make lie down"},{"surface":"בצהרים","gloss":"for afternoon"},{"surface":"שלמה","gloss":"why I go"},{"surface":"אהיה","gloss":"be"},{"surface":"כעטיה","gloss":"like woman wey veil herself"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"beside"},{"surface":"עדרי","gloss":"di flocks"},{"surface":"חבריך","gloss":"of your companions"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-11T13:28:46.593455161Z","model":"glm-5.2"}